            },
            "description": "**Who**: everyone — you only ever see your own tickets.\n\nThe response carries every dropdown list the screen needs: `categories`, `statuses`, `priorities`.\n\nSupport actually works in Waz Business, so `waz_tickets` is the list as the team sees it and is the source of truth for status and replies. When `waz_available` is false that system is unreachable right now — show `items` and warn that the status may be stale."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "get support ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
