            "description": "**Who**: everyone, agents included.\n\nAll three fields are required; `category` is an id from `categories`.\n\nThe response carries `synced_with_support`. **The ticket is saved either way** — false only means syncing with the support system is delayed. Never ask the user to resend, it would create a duplicate.",
